"has none of. Only Negative keeps just the destinations that have gone below "
"zero - stock sold that was never counted in. Below a Quantity keeps only "
"what every destination is thin on. All leaves the comparison whole."
msgstr ""
"Quali righe tenere. Solo Mancanti tiene i prodotti che almeno una "
